68
00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:45.720
Secondly, while there are co-op,
if experiences null, combine

69
00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.840
split screen local co-op

70
00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:50.480
on a single machine with real time
