71
00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.560
shared states and gameplay mechanics
for meaningful interplay.

72
00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:54.920
Agency.

73
00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.320
Thirdly, existing knowledge on co-op
if design still remains

74
00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.560
fragmented
