80
00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:21.200
Agency with shared states.

81
00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:25.760
Using our game ether five is a case study.

82
00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.040
We argue that cooperative interactive
fiction

