99
00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.720
Realistic Kissing
Simulator inspired us to challenge

100
00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.880
conventional mechanics
in games and explore queer game design,

101
00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.880
