113
00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.560
Boberg states that queer game design
is the practice of deliberately using game

114
00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:22.400
mechanics and other design elements
to challenge normative expectations around

115
00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.400
