flesh, and audio visuals.

132
00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.320
In this project,
we experiment with auto ethnographic

133
00:07:20.320 --> 00:07:23.760
exploration through co-op play
and collaborative authorship.

134
00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:27.560
We examine how meaning emerges
through negotiated decisions, shared

135
00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:28.480
