170
00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.640
To solve this issue,

171
00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:27.320
and to make it easy for new developers
to make local co-op experiences in go.

172
00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:30.880
We developed to go to plugin
