that only one player can access at a time,

179
00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:55.320
so it should deny player entry
if the other player is already using it.

180
00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:59.240
Panels containing dialog choices
which are specific to each player,

181
00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.320
or shared panels containing special co-op
abilities, which both players

182
00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:05.080
